  <content>
  <note class="self-check"><para>After completing the square, Odem used the following steps when deriving the quadratic formula.</para>
<para>\(x^2+8x+16= -11+16\)
  \(x^2+8x+16=5\)</para>
<para>What should he do next?</para></note>
